/// Compute the parity of the number of adjacent-equal pair removals
/// performed by repeatedly removing any adjacent equal pair until stable.
/// Return "Yes" iff the number of removals is odd.
///
/// Key idea:
/// - The final stable string is exactly what you get from the standard
